# What a failed browser test leaves behind: screenshots and their differences
.vitest/

# Stored screenshots for the browser tests. Only the ones made on Linux, where CI runs, are
# kept in the repository. A screenshot made on another system is for that machine only: text
# is drawn differently on each system, and even from one version of a system to the next.
